        {
          "kind": "explain",
          "say": {
            "en": "A ratio a : b means for every a of the first, there are b of the second. Two ratios are proportional when both terms change by the same factor. A quick test: the outer terms multiplied equal the inner terms multiplied, a × d = b × c.",
